{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgoLzUJdtAmUawQUHRavi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Bat and ball**\n\nLet the ball cost b. Then the bat costs b + 1.00, and b + (b + 1.00) = 1.10. That gives 2b = 0.10, so b = 0.05.\n\n- Ball: **$0.05**\n- Bat: **$1.05**\n\nThe bat costs exactly $1.00 more than the ball, and together they cost $1.10. The tempting answer of 10¢ for the ball fails: the bat would be $1.10, and the total would be $1.20.\n\n**Three friends splitting $100**\n\nLet the third friend pay t. Then:\n\n- Second = t + 5\n- First = 2 × (t + 5) = 2t + 10\n\nThe total is t + (t + 5) + (2t + 10) = 4t + 15 = 100. So 4t = 85 and t = 21.25.\n\n- First: **$52.50**\n- Second: **$26.25**\n- Third: **$21.25**\n\nCheck: 52.50 + 26.25 + 21.25 = 100. The first pays twice the second (2 × 26.25 = 52.50), and the second pays $5 more than the third (21.25 + 5 = 26.25)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6064,"cache_read_input_tokens":12932,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6064},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"53c01a63-eaf4-434e-9051-935cb2a94067","uuid":"6ee23d33-e507-4376-96ae-b6b64b56b7e1","timestamp":"2026-11-07T09:39:25.933Z","request_id":"req_011CgoLzU7yR3ixJW8nSezfU"}
